></div><section id="send-a-parcel-to-qatar" class="section-wrapper" index="1" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7ww2p7c43Q3gHO1_Qatar614b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7ww2p7c43Q3gHO1_Qatar.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C5624%2C3751&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7ww2p7c43Q3gHO1_Qatar.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C5624%2C3751&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7ww2p7c43Q3gHO1_Qatar.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C5624%2C3751&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="The National Museum of Qatar can be pictured with palm trees in the foreground and clear blue skies. The building is contemporary in design and looks like a desert rose." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Send a parcel to Qatar</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sending parcels from the UK to Qatar has never been easier. We deliver across Doha, Al Wakrah, Al Khor, and beyond. With our international courier services, you’ll get free end-to-end tracking and up to £20 parcel cover included as standard. Plus, we’ll deliver your parcel in 7 to 11 working days.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’ve got gifts to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/saudi-arabia" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->send to Saudi Arabia<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or you’re <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/kuwait" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->shipping to Kuwait<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, you can reach 200+ countries and territories with us.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="middle-east-service-update" class="landing-feature-banner2 landing-feature-banner2--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner2" data-slice-variation="default" data-v-52061f53><div class="landing-feature-banner2__container" data-v-52061f53><div class="landing-feature-banner2__image-container" data-v-52061f53><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices524d.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above." width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner2__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-52061f53></div><div class="landing-feature-banner2__content--standard landing-feature-banner2__content" data-v-52061f53><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner2__title" data-v-52061f53>Middle East Service Update</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner2__rich-text landing-feature-banner2__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner2__rich-text--padding" data-v-52061f53><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a result of the situation in the middle east, international services to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->UAE, Bahrain, Kuwait, Israel, Lebanon and Qatar <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->are facing significant delays. Any shipments in transit to these destinations will be accepted and held until it is clear to send them.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner2__button-wrapper" data-v-52061f53><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner2__button landing-feature-banner2__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/service-status" data-v-52061f53 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Check Service Status<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div></div></section><section id="how-much-is-it-to-send-a-parcel-to-qatar?" class="section-wrapper information-table" index="3" data-v-d2116e83 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="information-table__title" data-v-d2116e83>How much is it to send a parcel to Qatar?</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-d2116e83>The price of sending packages to Qatar will depend on the size and weight . You can send up to 15kg with our couriers. See how cheap it can be based on some of our more popular parcel weights:</p><div class="information-table__wrap" data-v-d2116e83><table class="information-table__element" data-v-d2116e83><thead class="information-table__table-header" data-v-d2116e83><tr data-v-d2116e83><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</th><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</th><!----></tr></thead><tbody data-v-d2116e83><!--[--><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>250g</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£12.99</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>500g</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£13.69</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>1kg</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£18.39</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>2kg</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£26.89</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>5kg+</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£40.19</span></td><!----></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="information-table__table-footer" data-v-d2116e83><small data-v-d2116e83>Prices quoted are ‘starting from’ and may change based on the volumetric weight of a parcel.</small></p><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-d2116e83><!----></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="public-holidays-in-qatar" class="section-wrapper" index="4" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Public holidays in Qatar</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Like many countries we deliver to, Qatar has several local and public holidays. While we aim to deliver parcels within 7 to 11 working days, the delivery times can increase around these occasions. We’d recommend checking if your parcel could be in transit near the following days and sending earlier to help avoid potential delays:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Eid al-Fitr<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 20/03/2026 - 21/03/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Arafat<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 25/05/2026 - 26/05/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Eid al-Adha <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 26/05/2026 - 30/05/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Islamic New Year (Al-Hijra)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 16/06/2026 - 17/06/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Qatar National Day <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 18/12/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="how-to-send-a-parcel-to-qatar" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->How to send a parcel to Qatar<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’ve made sending parcels to Qatar simple with three easy options:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJUpbqstJ9-Tf9_EVRI_LOCATION_03_30808a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJUpbqstJ9-Tf9_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3080.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJUpbqstJ9-Tf9_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3080.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJUpbqstJ9-Tf9_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3080.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Drop off your parcel at any of our 9,000+ ParcelShops across the UK after booking online. You can print your label at home or in-store for free. We’re also in selected Post Offices if you prefer to book your delivery with us in person.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-ParcelShops-open ParcelShops page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->ParcelShops<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage20cda.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=21%2C0%2C4960%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=21%2C0%2C4960%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=21%2C0%2C4960%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Woman opening blue locker to place cardboard box inside" width="1000" height="672" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Use our 24/7 Lockers to drop off parcels at your convenience. Book your delivery online, head to one of our nearby locations and scan your barcode. Place your parcel in an available space and we’ll send it on its way!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button-