ion-button-doineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtoqatar" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtoqatar-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our simple guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-send-an-international-parcel" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send an international parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="willimporttaxesapplytoparcelssenttoqatar-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-willimporttaxesapplytoparcelssenttoqatar" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-willimporttaxesapplytoparcelssenttoqatar" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Will import taxes apply to parcels sent to Qatar?-open answer" data-test-id="willimporttaxesapplytoparcelssenttoqatar-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!-